  "body": "> Web apps should be able to do anything native apps can. We want to make it possible for you to build and deliver apps on the open web that have never been possible before.\r\n-- https://web.dev/fugu-status/\r\n\r\nIs there a reason why the Web Serial API is currently not supported on Android/mobile?\r\n\r\n**Background**:\r\nWe currently experiment with the Web Serial API to control ultrasonic measurement devices and are very pleased with the results! Those ultrasonic devices can be connected to a desktop PC or to a tablet or smartphone with USB OTG. A full support of the serial API on mobile/desktop would allow us to just deploy a single PWA to our customers and stop the development of native apps.\r\n\r\nUsing the polyfill on top of Web USB for Android (https://github.com/google/web-serial-polyfill) doesn't work with our device/driver.",
